Above Regex Patterns:

(?i)^adm[^i]: Matches usernames starting with "adm" but not followed by "i" (case-insensitive).

\d{3,}: Matches usernames with 3 or more consecutive digits.

[^\w.-]: Matches usernames containing special characters.

(.)\1{2}: Matches usernames with 3 or more consecutive repeating characters.

^[\w]{1,5}$: Matches usernames that are 1 to 5 characters long.

